diff --git a/i18n/tools/update_strings.py.md b/i18n/tools/update_strings.py.md
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..23b746c59
--- /dev/null
+++ b/i18n/tools/update_strings.py.md
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# update_strings.py
+
+Run `python i18n/tools/update_strings.py` from the fork root after changing a menu label, tooltip,
+or the Enhanced sky field table. It scans the native UI and related options, writes `i18n/remix.pot`
+and merges the active languages' PO files in UTF-8. Translate new entries in each catalog.
+
+`--check` exits 0 when the template is current. `--stats` prints extraction counts. The language setup
+and the separate glyph and printf checks are described in [the localization guide](../README.md).
