+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:710
+msgid "Fires one strike now, even at 0 strikes per minute. It needs Enable Lightning. A daytime in-cloud flash is barely visible, as real lightning is."
+msgstr "立即触发一次闪电，即使每分钟为 0 次。需要启用闪电。白天云内闪光和真实闪电一样不易察觉。"
+
