+msgid "Screen Clouds"
+msgstr "屏幕云层"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:851 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:133
+msgid "Dispatch Cloud Render"
+msgstr "执行云层渲染"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:852 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:134
+msgid "Dispatch Cloud Sky Transmittance"
+msgstr "执行云层天空透射率计算"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:853 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:135
+msgid "Dispatch Sky LUTs"
+msgstr "更新天空 LUT"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:854 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:136
+msgid "Sky Miss Shading"
+msgstr "未命中光线的天空着色"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:858
+msgid "All settings"
+msgstr "所有设置"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:865
+msgid "Distance Haze"
+msgstr "远景雾霭"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:866
+msgid "Adds haze, fog and sun shafts to the air between you and distant terrain, buildings and clouds. It is the main sense of depth outdoors."
+msgstr "在你与远处地形、建筑和云层之间绘制雾霭、雾和太阳光束，形成户外的主要纵深感。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:870
+msgid "Haze Amount"
+msgstr "雾霭量"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:871
+msgid "How much dust and haze is in the air. 1 is typical. Higher values give a hazier, whiter sky, thicker haze over distant land and a larger glow around the sun."
+msgstr "空气中的尘埃和雾霭量。1 为典型值。提高数值会使天空更白、远处雾霭更浓，太阳周围的辉光更宽。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:875
+msgid "Scale used to measure distance through haze. 1 is real size. A smaller scale puts more haze between the camera and the same surface."
+msgstr "用于测量雾霭距离的尺度。1 为真实尺度。降低尺度会使相机与同一表面之间的雾霭更浓。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:879
+msgid "Ground Fog Visibility"
+msgstr "地面雾能见度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:880
+msgid "How far you can see through low-lying fog, in meters. Lower values give thicker fog: 50 is thick fog, 1000 mist and 10000 light haze. 0 turns the ground fog off."
+msgstr "低空雾中的能见度，以米计。数值越小雾越浓：50 为浓雾，1000 为薄雾，10000 为轻霭。0 关闭地面雾。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:884
+msgid "Sun Shafts"
+msgstr "太阳光束"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:885
+msgid "Lets buildings, trees and doorways shadow the haze. This gives sun shafts and keeps interiors from filling with sunlit haze. It costs some GPU time."
+msgstr "让建筑、树木和门洞遮挡雾霭，形成太阳光束，避免室内充满日照雾霭。会增加一些 GPU 耗时。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:888
+msgid "Light Glow in Haze"
+msgstr "雾霭中的灯光辉光"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:889
+msgid "Lets lamps, fires, muzzle flashes and other lights glow in the nearby haze. It costs more GPU time where many lights are close together on screen."
+msgstr "让灯具、火焰、枪口闪光和其他光源在近处雾霭中发光。当许多光源集中在屏幕同一区域时，GPU 开销较高。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:895
+msgid "Night Brightness"
+msgstr "夜间亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:896
+msgid "Brightens the night: moonlight, starlight and the night sky, together. 0 is physically correct, which looks darker on a screen than to your eyes at night. Each step of 1 doubles the brightness. Sunlight, sunsets and your own lights are not changed."
+msgstr "一起提高月光、星光和夜空的亮度。0 为物理亮度，在屏幕上会比人眼在夜间所见更暗。每增加 1 档亮度翻倍。日光、日落和自定义光源保持不变。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:902
+msgid "Brightens or dims the stars and the Milky Way on top of Night Brightness, without changing the moon. Each step of 1 doubles the brightness. Daylight is not changed."
+msgstr "在夜间亮度的基础上调整恒星和银河。每增加 1 档，亮度翻倍。月亮和日光保持不变。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:906
+msgid "Moonlight Brightness"
+msgstr "月光亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:907
+msgid "Brightens or dims the moon's light on the world and the sky, on top of Night Brightness. Lower it if the moon is too strong next to the stars. Daylight is not changed."
+msgstr "在夜间亮度的基础上调整照亮世界和天空的月光。若月光相对星光太强，可降低此值。日光保持不变。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:911
+msgid "Moon Disc Brightness"
+msgstr "月面亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:912
+msgid "Brightens or dims only the moon you see in the sky, not its light, so a blown-out moon can be tamed without darkening the night."
+msgstr "只调整天空中月面的亮度。可以压低过曝的月面，同时保留夜景的照明。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:918 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:71
+msgid "Draws volumetric clouds in the sky."
+msgstr "在天空中绘制体积云。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:920
+msgid "Cloud Coverage"
+msgstr "云层覆盖率"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:921
+msgid "How much of the sky is covered by cloud, from 0 (clear) to 1 (overcast)."
+msgstr "云层覆盖的天空比例，从 0（晴朗）到 1（阴天）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:923
+msgid "Cloud Density"
+msgstr "云密度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:924
+msgid "How thick and opaque the clouds are. Higher values give darker, more solid clouds."
+msgstr "云层的厚实与不透明程度。数值越高，云层越暗、越厚重。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:927
+msgid "The kind of cloud, from 0 to 1: 0 is flat layered cloud, 0.5 broken lumpy cloud and 1 tall, puffy cumulus."
+msgstr "云类型范围从 0 到 1：0 为平坦层云，0.5 为破碎的层积云，1 为高耸蓬松的积云。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:930
+msgid "Cloud Shadows"
+msgstr "云影"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:931
+msgid "How strongly clouds shade the ground and the air below them, from 0 (no cloud shadows) to 1 (physical)."
+msgstr "云层为地面和下方空气投下阴影的强度，从 0（无云影）到 1（物理强度）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:938
+msgid "Cloud Quality"
+msgstr "云层质量"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:939
+msgid "Quality draws the clouds' fine detail and sun shadows in full. Performance is faster: it uses a simpler sun shadow, so fine detail is softer and cloud tops look slightly brighter when the sun is low."
+msgstr "质量模式完整绘制云层细节和太阳阴影。性能模式简化太阳阴影以加快渲染，云层细节较柔和，太阳较低时云顶稍亮。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:947
+msgid "Cloud Resolution"
+msgstr "云层分辨率"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:948
+msgid "How many cloud pixels are traced each frame. The rest are rebuilt from their neighbors and earlier frames. Auto chooses from your resolution and upscaling. Full traces every pixel and costs the most. Quarter costs about a quarter and looks the same when the view is still. Sixteenth is the cheapest, but noisy and soft in motion."
+msgstr "每帧追踪的云像素比例。其余像素由相邻样本和先前帧重建。自动模式根据分辨率和超分辨率选择。全采样追踪所有像素，开销最高。四分之一模式开销约为四分之一，静止时外观相近。十六分之一最省，但运动时较模糊且噪点较多。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:966
+#, c-format
+msgid "NUMOS shaders could not be loaded. Check the Remix log and the numos folder beside d3d9.dll."
+msgstr "无法加载 NUMOS 着色器。请检查 Remix 日志和 d3d9.dll 旁的 numos 文件夹。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:982
+msgid "Night"
+msgstr "夜晚"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:986
+msgid "Weather"
+msgstr "天气"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:988
+#, c-format
+msgid "Current weather: %s"
+msgstr "当前天气：%s"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:989 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:1024
+msgid "Weather presets"
+msgstr "天气预设"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:995
+msgid "Setup"
+msgstr "配置"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:1007
+msgid "Night Settings"
+msgstr "夜间设置"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:1009
+msgid "Haze Settings"
+msgstr "雾霭设置"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:1011
+msgid "Cloud Settings"
+msgstr "云层设置"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:1030
+msgid "Choose Custom settings to use the current sky controls without a built-in weather preset."
+msgstr "选择“自定义设置”可直接使用当前天空参数，无需内置天气预设。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:1032
+msgid "Built-in weather"
+msgstr "内置天气"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:1046
+msgid "Follow game weather"
+msgstr "跟随游戏天气"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:1047
+msgid "Weather transition"
+msgstr "天气过渡时间"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:1051
+#, c-format
+msgid "Game weather: %s"
+msgstr "游戏天气：%s"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui.cpp:1055
+#, c-format
+msgid "Transition from %s: %.0f%%"
+msgstr "从 %s 过渡：%.0f%%"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:3
+msgid "Add haze, fog and lamp glow between the camera and distant surfaces."
+msgstr "在相机与远处表面之间绘制雾霭、雾和灯光辉光。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:4
+msgid "Display a haze measurement and its scale at the bottom of the screen."
+msgstr "显示雾霭诊断量及屏幕底部的标尺。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:4
+msgid "Haze Diagnostic"
+msgstr "雾霭诊断"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:5
+msgid "Increase to discard old haze lighting faster when a shadow moves."
+msgstr "提高此值可在阴影移动时更快舍弃旧的雾霭光照。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:5
+msgid "Shadow Response"
+msgstr "阴影响应"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:6
+msgid "Off-screen History Margin"
+msgstr "屏幕外历史边距"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:6
+msgid "Set how far beyond the screen edge a froxel may reuse history."
+msgstr "设置 froxel 可复用历史数据的屏幕边缘外范围。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:7
+msgid "Refresh Revealed Haze"
+msgstr "刷新新显露的雾霭"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:7
+msgid "Refresh haze sooner when a previously hidden region becomes visible."
+msgstr "先前被遮挡的区域重新可见时，更快刷新雾霭。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:8
+msgid "More depth slices sharpen nearby haze but increase GPU time and memory use."
+msgstr "增加深度切片可改善近处雾霭细节，同时增加 GPU 耗时和显存用量。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:9
+msgid "How far nearby shadows reach into mist. Try 6,000 m beneath a low cloud sheet."
+msgstr "近处的阴影在雾中延伸的距离。低云幕下可试 6,000 m。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:10
+msgid "Width of a haze cell in render pixels. At 1080p, 8 gives a 240x135 grid."
+msgstr "雾霭单元的宽度，以渲染像素计。在 1080p 下，取 8 时网格为 240x135。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:11
+msgid "Stagger Sun and Sky Samples"
+msgstr "交错采样太阳和天空"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:11
+msgid "Vary the sun and sky sampling order per froxel to suppress checkerboard patterns."
+msgstr "为每个 froxel 改变太阳与天空的采样顺序，以减轻棋盘格伪影。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:12
+msgid "Number of frames averaged for nearby haze lighting."
+msgstr "近处雾霭光照参与平均的帧数。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:13
+msgid "Ignore a local light where its contribution falls below this brightness."
+msgstr "局部光源在某处的亮度贡献低于此值时将被忽略。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:14
+msgid "Average local-light visibility over this many neighbouring froxels on each side."
+msgstr "在每侧指定数量的相邻 froxel 上平均局部光源的可见性。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:14
+msgid "Local Shadow Filter Radius"
+msgstr "局部阴影滤波半径"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:15
+msgid "Scale the glow of local lights in haze. 1 is physical."
+msgstr "调整局部光源在雾霭中的辉光。1 为物理亮度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:16
+msgid "Limit the number of scene lights used for nearby haze each frame."
+msgstr "限制每帧用于近处雾霭的场景光源数量。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:17
+msgid "Trace shadows so a lamp cannot light fog through a wall."
+msgstr "追踪阴影，防止灯光穿过墙壁照亮雾。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:18
+msgid "Keep the brightest local lights in each screen tile, up to this limit."
+msgstr "每个屏幕图块只保留最亮的局部光源，数量由此值限制。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:18
+msgid "Lights per Screen Tile"
+msgstr "每个屏幕图块的光源数"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:19
+msgid "Fade a lamp's glow smoothly at the edge of its range."
+msgstr "在灯光范围边缘平滑淡出辉光。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:20
+msgid "Lets lamps light Enhanced mist. Expect longer frame times near many lamps or with the flashlight on."
+msgstr "让灯光照亮增强雾。附近灯具很多或打开手电筒时，每帧的渲染时间会变长。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:21
+msgid "Limit forward scattering in the haze in front of surfaces."
+msgstr "限制表面前方雾霭中的前向散射。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:22
+msgid "Sample Penumbrae Every Frame"
+msgstr "每帧采样半影"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:22
+msgid "Sample partially shadowed haze every frame to track moving shadow edges."
+msgstr "每帧采样部分处于阴影中的雾霭，以跟踪移动的阴影边缘。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:23
+msgid "History for Revealed Haze"
+msgstr "新显露雾霭的历史"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:23
+msgid "Limit history length in newly revealed haze."
+msgstr "限制新显露雾霭的历史帧数。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:24
+msgid "Let geometry cast sun and sky shadows into nearby haze."
+msgstr "让几何体在近处雾霭中投下太阳和天空光的阴影。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:25
+msgid "Move haze samples in front of silhouettes to reduce dark halos."
+msgstr "将雾霭样本移到物体轮廓前方，减轻暗色光晕。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:25
+msgid "Protect Silhouettes"
+msgstr "保护轮廓"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:26
+msgid "Skip Hidden Haze Cells"
+msgstr "跳过被遮挡的雾霭单元"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:26
+msgid "Skip haze rays behind fully occluding surfaces."
+msgstr "跳过完全被表面遮挡的雾霭光线。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:27
+msgid "Sample the Sky Every Frame at Night"
+msgstr "夜间每帧采样天空"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:27
+msgid "Use the sun's sampling slot for the sky when the sun is below the horizon."
+msgstr "太阳位于地平线以下时，将太阳的采样机会用于天空。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:28
+msgid "Average sky visibility across neighbouring haze cells."
+msgstr "在相邻雾霭单元间平均天空可见性。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:28
+msgid "Sky Visibility Filter Radius"
+msgstr "天空可见性滤波半径"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:29
+msgid "Number of frames used to average sky visibility in nearby haze."
+msgstr "用于平均近处雾霭中天空可见性的帧数。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:29
+msgid "Sky Visibility History"
+msgstr "天空可见性历史"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:30
+msgid "Depth Tolerance at Edges"
+msgstr "边缘深度容差"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:30
+msgid "Reject upsampling across depth changes to keep haze on the correct side of edges."
+msgstr "放大时拒绝跨越深度突变的样本，防止雾霭渗过边缘。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:31
+msgid "Try 1 for clean air, 10 for a soft glow around the Sun and 50 for white haze."
+msgstr "设为 1 时空气清澈，10 时太阳周围泛起柔光，50 时天空笼上一层白霾。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:32
+msgid "Choose white for neutral haze or a sandy tint for dusty air."
+msgstr "白色可保持中性的薄霾，沙黄色适合尘土弥漫的空气。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:33
+msgid "1 gives Earth-like air. More air deepens the blue and reddens sunsets."
+msgstr "1 接近地球大气。提高密度会让天空更蓝，落日更红。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:34
+msgid "Tints the clear sky between clouds. White keeps the natural sky colours."
+msgstr "为云间的晴空着色。白色保留天空的自然色彩。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:35
+msgid "Atmosphere thickness in km. Earth uses approximately 100 km."
+msgstr "大气层厚度，以 km 计。地球约为 100 km。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:36
+msgid "Set the calendar year used for the Moon and stars."
+msgstr "设置月球和星空使用的日历年份。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:37
+msgid "World-space position used to anchor clouds when the camera override is enabled."
+msgstr "启用相机覆盖时，用此世界坐标定位云层。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:38
+msgid "A camera jump beyond this distance in km rebuilds the cloud reflection dome."
+msgstr "相机移动距离超过此阈值（km）时重建云层反射穹顶。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:39
+msgid "Height of the cloud bottoms above the ground."
+msgstr "云层底部离地面的高度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:40
+msgid "Raise this to cover the large lumps with smaller, stronger ones."
+msgstr "提高数值，会让大块隆起表面的小突起更加明显。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:41
+msgid "Width of the largest rounded lumps in a cloud."
+msgstr "云中最大圆形隆起的宽度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:42
+msgid "Displace the cloud surface by a fraction of billow size. At 0 the towers are smooth."
+msgstr "按云团大小的一定比例起伏云面。设为 0 时云塔表面平滑。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:43
+msgid "Move cloud-top detail downwind while keeping the base in place. 0 stops the shear."
+msgstr "让云顶细节顺风移动，云底保持原位。0 会停止风切变。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:44
+msgid "Small clusters scatter across the sky. Large ones form broad banks."
+msgstr "小云团散布在天空中，大云团会连成宽阔的云带。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:45
+msgid "Real cirrus usually forms between 6,000 and 13,000 metres."
+msgstr "真实的卷云通常出现在 6,000 至 13,000 米高空。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:46
+msgid "Choose between a few isolated streaks and a sky full of them."
+msgstr "可以只留下几缕卷云，也可以让它们铺满天空。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:47
+msgid "Adds thin ice streaks that can stay sunlit after the lower clouds darken."
+msgstr "添加细长的冰晶云带。低层云变暗后，它们仍可能被阳光照亮。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:48
+msgid "Brightens the ring around the Sun or Moon where light meets ice crystals."
+msgstr "增强光线穿过冰晶时在太阳或月亮周围形成的光环。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:49
+msgid "Choose a new pattern for cirrus streaks."
+msgstr "为卷云选择新的条纹分布。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:49
+msgid "Cirrus Pattern Seed"
+msgstr "卷云图案种子"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:50
+msgid "Around 0.1 gives fine transparent streaks. At 1 they look thick."
+msgstr "约 0.1 时是纤细透明的云丝，设为 1 时显得厚实。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:51
+msgid "Turns the streaks across the sky independently of the lower wind."
+msgstr "旋转云丝的走向，不受低空风向限制。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:52
+msgid "Cirrus Wind Scale"
+msgstr "卷云风速倍率"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:52
+msgid "Scale cirrus drift relative to the wind speed of the lower clouds."
+msgstr "按低层云风速的倍数调整卷云漂移速度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:53
+msgid "Tints the main cloud layer. White keeps the colour of its light."
+msgstr "为主云层着色。白色保留照在云上的光色。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:54
+msgid "Vary the height of cloud bases across the sky."
+msgstr "改变天空中各处的云底高度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:55
+msgid "Low values give sharp outlines. High values soften the edges."
+msgstr "数值低时轮廓清晰，数值高时边缘柔和。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:56
+msgid "Shape the height profile of individual cloud towers."
+msgstr "调整各个云塔的高度轮廓。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:57
+msgid "Low values line up the tops. High values let individual towers rise."
+msgstr "数值低时云顶齐平，数值高时有些云会高高耸起。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:58
+msgid "0 clears the main layer. At 1 it covers most of the sky."
+msgstr "0 会清空主云层。设为 1 时，云会遮住大部分天空。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:59
+msgid "Set the spatial frequency of patches of cloud cover."
+msgstr "设置云量斑块的空间频率。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:60
+msgid "Raise this to put clear gaps next to crowded banks of cloud."
+msgstr "提高数值，让密集的云团之间出现开阔的晴空。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:61
+msgid "Fill Short History Across Tiles"
+msgstr "跨图块补全短历史"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:61
+msgid "Fill newly visible cloud pixels from samples in neighbouring tiles."
+msgstr "利用相邻图块的样本填充新显露的云像素。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:62
+msgid "Pulls the underside sideways into wisps. At 0 it hangs straight."
+msgstr "将云底向侧面拉成细丝。0 时云底自然垂下。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:63
+msgid "Denser clouds block more sunlight and have darker bases."
+msgstr "越密的云遮挡的阳光越多，底部也越暗。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:64
+msgid "Vertical distance from cloud base to cloud top."
+msgstr "从云底到云顶的垂直距离。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:65
+msgid "Negative bias preserves finer detail. Positive bias smooths distant cloud detail."
+msgstr "负偏置保留更精细的细节，正偏置使远处云层更平滑。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:66
+msgid "Use coarser detail textures where the cloud ray takes long steps."
+msgstr "云光线步长较大时使用较粗的细节纹理。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:67
+msgid "Lets scattered sunlight brighten the undersides of thick clouds."
+msgstr "让散射的阳光照亮厚云的底面。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:68
+msgid "Draw the glow from droplets around the sun or moon behind thin clouds."
+msgstr "在薄云后的太阳或月亮周围绘制云滴产生的辉光。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:69
+msgid "Smaller droplets produce a wider glow. A typical diameter is 20 um."
+msgstr "云滴越小，辉光越宽。典型直径为 20 um。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:70
+msgid "Skip filtering pixels that carried no cloud in either frame."
+msgstr "跳过连续两帧均无云的像素滤波。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:72
+msgid "Moves detail upward inside each cloud. At 0 its shape stops rising."
+msgstr "让每朵云的内部纹理向上涌动。设为 0 时云形停止向上生长。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:73
+msgid "Full Rate Inside Clouds"
+msgstr "云内全采样率"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:73
+msgid "In Auto mode, trace every pixel when moving inside clouds or a fog bank."
+msgstr "自动模式下，在云层或雾团内移动时追踪每个像素。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:74
+msgid "Rotate and offset tiles to hide repetition in the cloud pattern."
+msgstr "旋转并偏移图块，隐藏云层纹理的重复。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:75
+msgid "Lower the tolerance to reject history across larger depth changes."
+msgstr "降低容差可在深度变化时更严格地拒绝历史样本。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:76
+msgid "White scatters all colours. A warmer, darker tint can suggest dust."
+msgstr "白色散射所有颜色的光。较暗的暖色能营造沙尘感。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:77
+msgid "Set the base near zero for ground fog or raise it for a high deck."
+msgstr "接近零时形成地面雾，调高则形成高空云幕。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:78
+msgid "Offset the second layer's base from the camera in m when it follows the camera."
+msgstr "第二层云跟随相机时，用此值设置云底相对相机的偏移（m）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:79
+msgid "Raise this until separate patches join into a sheet."
+msgstr "逐渐提高数值，直到分散的云片连成一片。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:80
+msgid "A multiple of the main cloud density. At 0 the sheet disappears."
+msgstr "相对于主云层的密度倍数。设为 0 时云幕消失。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:81
+msgid "A shallow layer makes a thin veil. A deep one fills more of the sky."
+msgstr "薄层像轻纱，厚层会占据更多天空。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:82
+msgid "Adds a separate sheet above the clouds or a fog bank near the ground."
+msgstr "在云层上方添加独立的云幕，也可以在近地面形成雾带。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:83
+msgid "Keep the second cloud layer at a fixed height relative to the camera."
+msgstr "让第二层云相对相机保持固定高度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:84
+msgid "Change the layout of patches in the second cloud layer."
+msgstr "改变第二层云的斑块分布。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:85
+msgid "At 0 the sheet is thickest at its base. At 1 its middle bulges."
+msgstr "0 时云幕底部最厚。1 时中部隆起。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:86
+msgid "Vary the cloud type across the second layer independently of the main deck."
+msgstr "独立于主云层，改变第二层各处的云类型。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:87
+msgid "Reuse more lighting samples in distant clouds to save GPU time."
+msgstr "在远处云层中复用更多光照样本以节省 GPU 时间。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:88
+msgid "Reuse lighting for faint samples. At 0 every sample is lit separately."
+msgstr "复用亮度贡献较小样本的光照。设为 0 时每个样本单独计算。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:89
+msgid "End a cloud ray at 3% transmission instead of 1% to save work in thick clouds."
+msgstr "在透射率降至 3% 而非 1% 时结束光线，减少厚云中的计算。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:90
+msgid "Set the fraction of cloud pixels traced each frame. Auto follows render and output resolution."
+msgstr "设置每帧追踪的云像素比例。自动模式根据渲染和输出分辨率选择。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:91
+msgid "Limit automatic cloud rays per frame in millions. 0 removes the limit."
+msgstr "限制自动模式下每帧的云光线数，单位为百万。0 取消限制。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:92
+msgid "Approximate 1 to 4 scattering orders. More orders brighten cloud interiors."
+msgstr "近似计算 1 到 4 阶散射。阶数越多，云层内部越亮。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:93
+msgid "Distance in km before the cloud detail pattern repeats."
+msgstr "云层细节图案的重复间距，以 km 计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:94
+msgid "Performance uses simpler sun shadows to reduce cloud rendering cost."
+msgstr "性能模式使用较简单的太阳阴影，降低云层渲染开销。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:95
+msgid "Increase forward scattering for brighter silver linings around backlit clouds."
+msgstr "提高前向散射可使逆光云层的银边更亮。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:96
+msgid "Write cloud GPU timings to the existing Remix log every 120 frames."
+msgstr "每 120 帧将云层 GPU 耗时写入现有的 Remix 日志。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:97
+msgid "Compare normal cloud lighting with a slower reference path tracer."
+msgstr "将常规云层光照与较慢的参考路径追踪器进行比较。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:98
+msgid "Choose how the GPU schedules quarter-rate cloud sampling and reconstruction."
+msgstr "选择 GPU 调度四分之一采样率云层采样与重建的方式。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:99
+msgid "Draw clouds directly in the camera view."
+msgstr "在相机视图中直接绘制云层。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:100
+msgid "Use a cached cloud dome for reflections and indirect light."
+msgstr "使用缓存的云穹顶计算反射和间接光。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:101
+msgid "Set how much of the cloud reflection dome is refreshed each frame."
+msgstr "设置每帧刷新的云反射穹顶比例。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:102
+msgid "Set how many of the 256 shadow-map rows are rebuilt per frame."
+msgstr "设置每帧重建阴影贴图 256 行中的多少行。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:103
+msgid "Cache cloud shadows in a map that follows the sun."
+msgstr "将云影缓存到随太阳更新的阴影贴图。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:104
+msgid "Limit the angle by which cloud shadows can lag behind a moving sun."
+msgstr "限制云影落后于太阳移动的角度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:105
+msgid "Rebuild the cloud shadow map when the sun moves by this angle."
+msgstr "太阳移动达到此角度时重建云影贴图。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:106
+msgid "Half-width of the most detailed cloud shadow map around the camera, in km."
+msgstr "相机周围最高精度云影贴图的半宽，以 km 计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:107
+msgid "At 1 clouds shade the ground and air fully. At 0 their shadows disappear."
+msgstr "1 时云会在地面和空气中投下完整的阴影。0 时云影消失。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:108
+msgid "Control how much clouds block and scatter ambient skylight."
+msgstr "控制云层遮挡和散射天空环境光的程度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:109
+msgid "Smooth noisy clouds while preserving their edges."
+msgstr "在保留边缘的同时平滑云层噪点。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:110
+msgid "Lower values let later scattering orders reach deeper into the cloud."
+msgstr "较低的值使高阶散射光穿透云层更深。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:111
+msgid "Set the contribution of each successive scattering order."
+msgstr "设置每个后续散射阶的光照贡献。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:112
+msgid "Lower values spread later scattering orders more evenly in all directions."
+msgstr "较低的值使高阶散射光更均匀地分布到各个方向。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:113
+msgid "Use 1 to 8 orders of scattered sunlight. Denser clouds benefit from more orders."
+msgstr "使用 1 到 8 阶太阳光散射。较多阶数有助于照亮密云。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:114
+msgid "Keep more history for smoother clouds, at the cost of longer motion trails."
+msgstr "保留更多历史样本可使云层更平滑，但会延长运动拖影。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:115
+msgid "Minimum History Inside Clouds"
+msgstr "云内最短历史"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:115
+msgid "Minimum cloud history length while moving inside a cloud or fog bank."
+msgstr "在云层或雾团内移动时保留的最少历史帧数。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:116
+msgid "Smooth In-cloud Motion Gradient"
+msgstr "平滑云内运动梯度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:116
+msgid "Smooth the gradient used to limit trailing inside clouds."
+msgstr "平滑用于限制云内拖影的梯度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:117
+msgid "Stabilize In-cloud Depth"
+msgstr "稳定云内深度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:117
+msgid "Stabilize the depth used to reproject history inside clouds."
+msgstr "稳定云内历史样本重投影所用的深度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:118
+msgid "Number of samples averaged while the clouds and camera are still."
+msgstr "相机和云层静止时参与平均的样本数。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:119
+msgid "Move from flat sheets through low rolls to tall heaps."
+msgstr "从平坦的云幕，经过低矮的卷块，逐渐变为高耸的云堆。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:120
+msgid "Lower values produce larger regions of the same cloud type."
+msgstr "较低的值会扩大同一云类型的区域。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:121
+msgid "At 0 all clouds have the same shape. Raise it to mix shapes."
+msgstr "0 时所有云的形状相同。提高数值可混合不同云型。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:122
+msgid "Move the whole cloud field vertically in game world units."
+msgstr "以游戏世界单位垂直移动整个云场。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:123
+msgid "Base number of cloud steps when sample spacing is 0."
+msgstr "采样间距为 0 时的基础云层步数。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:124
+msgid "Limit the number of samples per ray through the main cloud layer."
+msgstr "限制每条光线穿过主云层时的采样数。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:125
+msgid "Set cloud sample spacing in km. Wider steps can miss thin clouds."
+msgstr "设置云采样间距（km）。较大步长可能漏掉薄云。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:126
+msgid "Distance in km the camera or cloud field moves before cloud lighting is updated."
+msgstr "相机或云场移动多少 km 后更新云层光照。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:127
+msgid "Let clouds cast shadows on the ground and in the air."
+msgstr "让云层在地面和空气中投下阴影。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:128
+msgid "History Reset After Weather Changes"
+msgstr "天气突变后重置历史"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:128
+msgid "Temporarily shorten cloud history after an abrupt weather change."
+msgstr "天气突变后暂时缩短云层历史。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:129
+msgid "Turns the direction of travel. Add 180 degrees to reverse it."
+msgstr "转动云的移动方向。增加 180 度可让云反向移动。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:130
+msgid "Moves the clouds across the map. 0.02 km/s is 20 metres each second."
+msgstr "让云在地图上移动。0.02 km/s 相当于每秒 20 米。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:131
+msgid "Real minutes per 24-hour sky cycle. Increase for a slower day."
+msgstr "天空完成 24 小时循环所需的现实分钟数。提高此值可减慢昼夜变化。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:132
+msgid "Choose the day of the year from 1 to 365 to set the season."
+msgstr "从 1 到 365 中选择一年中的日期以设置季节。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:133
+msgid "Run the screen cloud pass to include its cost when profiling."
+msgstr "运行屏幕云渲染通道，以便在性能分析中计入其开销。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:134
+msgid "Run the pass that measures how much sky is visible through clouds."
+msgstr "运行测量云层天空透射率的通道。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:135
+msgid "Update sky lookup tables as the sun and atmosphere change."
+msgstr "随太阳和大气变化更新天空查找表。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:136
+msgid "Shade rays that miss the scene. Turn off to compare against a flat grey sky."
+msgstr "为未命中场景的光线计算天空着色。关闭可与纯灰天空比较。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:137
+msgid "Scale the sunlight and moonlight cast onto the scene."
+msgstr "调整太阳光和月光投射到场景中的强度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:138
+msgid "Reverse the sky's up axis if the sky appears upside down."
+msgstr "天空上下颠倒时反转其向上轴。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:139
+msgid "High values scatter light into view. Low values make fog dark like smoke."
+msgstr "数值高时雾把更多光散向眼前。数值低时雾会像烟一样暗。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:140
+msgid "Positive values brighten fog when you look toward a light. Zero spreads light evenly."
+msgstr "数值为正时，朝向光源看会觉得雾更亮。0 会把光均匀散向各处。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:141
+msgid "Height above the ground where fog reaches the chosen visibility."
+msgstr "雾达到所选能见度时的离地高度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:142
+msgid "Small values confine fog to the ground. Larger values keep it thick higher up."
+msgstr "数值小时雾贴近地面，数值大时高处也有浓雾。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:143
+msgid "Fade ground fog in gradually from the camera over this distance in m."
+msgstr "让地面雾从相机开始，在此距离（m）内逐渐加浓。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:144
+msgid "At 0 there is no height fog. Try 50 m for dense fog or 10,000 m for light haze."
+msgstr "0 会关闭高度雾。浓雾可试 50 m，轻薄的雾霭可试 10,000 m。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:145
+msgid "Set the fraction of light reflected by the planet's ground."
+msgstr "设置行星地表反射的光线比例。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:146
+msgid "Estimate the ground level from measured scene geometry."
+msgstr "测量场景几何体以估算地面高度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:147
+msgid "Set the atmospheric ground level in game world units."
+msgstr "以游戏世界单位设置大气模型的地面高度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:148
+msgid "Distance in m over which changes in the estimated ground height are smoothed."
+msgstr "平滑估算地面高度变化所用的距离，以 m 计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:149
+msgid "Scale distances for haze and fog separately from cloud distances."
+msgstr "独立于云层距离调整雾霭和雾的距离尺度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:150
+msgid "Observer latitude in degrees, used for the paths of the sun, moon and stars."
+msgstr "观测者纬度，以度计，用于计算太阳、月亮与星辰的轨迹。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:151
+msgid "Tint lightning in the clouds, air and scene."
+msgstr "调整云层、空气和场景中闪电的颜色。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:152
+msgid "Allow automatic and manually triggered lightning strikes."
+msgstr "允许自动和手动触发闪电。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:153
+msgid "Peak luminous intensity of a lightning flash in cd."
+msgstr "闪电的峰值发光强度，以 cd 计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:154
+msgid "Maximum distance in km between the camera and a lightning strike."
+msgstr "闪电与相机之间的最大距离，以 km 计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:155
+msgid "Add a scene light at the strike so lightning illuminates nearby surfaces."
+msgstr "在落雷处添加场景光源，使闪电照亮附近表面。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:156
+msgid "Average lightning flashes each minute. Zero turns automatic lightning off."
+msgstr "每分钟闪电的平均次数。设为零会关闭自动闪电。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:157
+msgid "Absorption by aerosols per km in each colour channel. Stronger absorption makes haze darker."
+msgstr "每个颜色通道中气溶胶每 km 的吸收系数。吸收越强，雾霭越暗。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:158
+msgid "Positive values concentrate the haze glow toward the Sun."
+msgstr "正值会让薄霾的光辉更集中在太阳方向。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:159
+msgid "Scattering by aerosols per km in each colour channel."
+msgstr "每个颜色通道中气溶胶每 km 的散射系数。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:160
+msgid "Apparent moon diameter in degrees. Earth's Moon spans about 0.518 degrees."
+msgstr "月亮的视直径，以度计。地球的月亮约为 0.518 度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:161
+msgid "Tint the moon disc and the light it casts. White keeps the lunar albedo."
+msgstr "调整月面及其光照的颜色。白色保留月球反照率。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:162
+msgid "Moon elevation above the horizon in degrees."
+msgstr "月亮高出地平线的角度，以度计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:163
+msgid "Draw this additional moon at the configured position and phase."
+msgstr "以设置的位置和月相绘制这颗额外的月亮。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:164
+msgid "Set the lunar phase. A negative value derives the phase from the sun direction."
+msgstr "设置月相。负值会根据太阳方向计算月相。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:165
+msgid "Moon azimuth around the horizon in degrees."
+msgstr "月亮沿地平线的方位角，以度计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:166
+msgid "Adjust the visible moon disc in exposure stops without changing moonlight on surfaces."
+msgstr "以曝光档调整可见月面的亮度，保持表面月光不变。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:167
+msgid "Adds or removes stops of moonlight on clouds and the ground."
+msgstr "按档位增强或减弱照在云和地面上的月光。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:168
+msgid "Blend the approximate multiple scattering at 0 with the physical calculation at 1."
+msgstr "混合多重散射的近似值（0）和物理计算值（1）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:169
+msgid "Brighten all natural night light together. 0 is physical and each stop doubles brightness."
+msgstr "同时调亮所有自然夜光。0 为物理亮度，每增加一档亮度翻倍。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:170
+msgid "Draw catalogue stars and the Milky Way at their astronomical positions."
+msgstr "在天文位置绘制星表中的恒星和银河。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:171
+msgid "Align north in the sky with north in the game world."
+msgstr "使天空的北向与游戏世界的北向对齐。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:172
+msgid "Smallest cloud step in km. At 0 the march uses evenly spaced samples."
+msgstr "最小云层步长，以 km 计。设为 0 时使用等间距采样。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:173
+msgid "Higher values carve deeper gaps into the outlines of clouds."
+msgstr "提高数值会在云的轮廓上刻出更深的缺口。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:174
+msgid "Distance in km beyond which cloud sample jitter stops changing each frame."
+msgstr "超过此距离（km）后，云样本抖动不再逐帧变化。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:175
+msgid "Set how far cloud boundaries move in km as coverage changes."
+msgstr "设置云量变化时云边界移动的距离，以 km 计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:176
+msgid "Coverage used to build the cloud shape field. 0 follows the current coverage."
+msgstr "构建云形状场时使用的云量。0 表示跟随当前云量。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:177
+msgid "Distance in km over which density builds up from a cloud edge."
+msgstr "云层密度从边缘逐渐增大的距离，以 km 计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:178
+msgid "Set the fraction of the distance to a cloud used for a step through empty air."
+msgstr "设置穿过无云空气时，步长占到最近云层距离的比例。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:179
+msgid "Ozone absorption per km in each colour channel."
+msgstr "每个颜色通道中臭氧每 km 的吸收系数。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:180
+msgid "Raise this to deepen the blue sky during twilight."
+msgstr "提高数值可让暮光中的天空呈现更深的蓝色。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:181
+msgid "Height in km where the ozone layer is densest."
+msgstr "臭氧层密度最高处的高度，以 km 计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:182
+msgid "Half-thickness of the ozone layer in km."
+msgstr "臭氧层的半厚度，以 km 计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:183
+msgid "Radius of the planet in km. Earth's radius is about 6371 km."
+msgstr "行星半径，以 km 计。地球半径约为 6371 km。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:184
+msgid "Set the overall cloud and haze quality for this GPU."
+msgstr "设置适用于此 GPU 的云层与雾霭整体质量。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:185
+msgid "Use pre-exposure to preserve precision in dark skies."
+msgstr "使用预曝光保留暗天空的精度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:186
+msgid "Molecular scattering per km in each colour channel controls the blue of the sky."
+msgstr "各颜色通道中每 km 的分子散射系数决定天空的蓝色。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:187
+msgid "Set the real moon disc diameter in degrees. 0.518 matches Earth's Moon."
+msgstr "设置真实月面的视直径，以度计。0.518 对应地球的月亮。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:188
+msgid "Draw Earth's Moon using the selected date, time and latitude."
+msgstr "根据选定的日期、时间和纬度绘制地球的月亮。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:189
+msgid "Scale diffuse skylight on surfaces. 1 is physical."
+msgstr "调整表面接收的漫射天空光。1 为物理强度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:190
+msgid "Rebuild each sky lookup table only when its own inputs change."
+msgstr "仅在查找表自身的输入变化时重建对应的天空查找表。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:191
+msgid "Vertical camera travel in km required to rebuild the sky lookup table."
+msgstr "触发天空查找表重建所需的相机垂直移动距离，以 km 计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:192
+msgid "Angular motion of the sun or moon that triggers a sky lookup table update."
+msgstr "触发天空查找表更新所需的太阳或月亮移动角度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:193
+msgid "Adds or removes stops of light from the stars and the Milky Way."
+msgstr "按档位增强或减弱来自恒星和银河的光。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:194
+msgid "Stars near the horizon twinkle most. At 0 they stay steady."
+msgstr "地平线附近的星星闪烁最明显。设为 0 时星光保持稳定。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:195
+msgid "Set the height of the sun above the horizon in degrees."
+msgstr "设置太阳高出地平线的角度，以度计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:196
+msgid "Set the base colour and illuminance of the sun."
+msgstr "设置太阳的基础颜色和照度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:197
+msgid "Scale sunlight independently of natural night light."
+msgstr "独立于自然夜光调整太阳光强度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:198
+msgid "Set the compass direction of the sun in degrees."
+msgstr "设置太阳的方位角，以度计。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:199
+msgid "Set the angular light radius for sun shadows. At 0 it follows the visible disc."
+msgstr "设置太阳阴影所用的光源角半径。设为 0 时跟随可见日面的大小。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:200
+msgid "Angular diameter of the sun in degrees. 0.545 approximates the real sun."
+msgstr "太阳的视直径，以度计。0.545 接近真实太阳。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:201
+msgid "Use the built-in clock to move the sun throughout the day."
+msgstr "用内置时钟驱动太阳的全天运动。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:202
+msgid "Set solar time from 0 to 24 hours. 12 is noon."
+msgstr "设置 0 到 24 小时的太阳时。12 为正午。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:203
+msgid "Game world units per metre. At 0 the runtime uses rtx.sceneScale."
+msgstr "每米对应的游戏世界单位数。0 表示使用 rtx.sceneScale。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:204
+msgid "Anchor clouds to rtx.atmosphere.numos.cameraWorldOverride instead of the camera position."
+msgstr "使用 rtx.atmosphere.numos.cameraWorldOverride 代替相机位置来定位云层。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_ui_fields.inl:205
+msgid "Scale the sky, clouds, wind and lightning together relative to the game world."
+msgstr "相对游戏世界同时缩放天空、云层、风和闪电。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.numos.weather.preset
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_weather.h:31
+msgid "The weather preset the sky shows while the game reports no weather that is bound to a preset, or while rtx.atmosphere.numos.weather.followGame is off. The sky uses the NUMOS settings alone when this is empty."
+msgstr "当游戏未报告与预设匹配的天气，或 rtx.atmosphere.numos.weather.followGame 关闭时，天空使用此预设。留空时仅使用 NUMOS 参数。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.numos.weather.followGame
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_weather.h:34
+msgid "Enables showing the preset that is bound to the weather the game reports in rtx.atmosphere.numos.weather.gameWeather. The sky shows only rtx.atmosphere.numos.weather.preset when this is off."
+msgstr "显示与 rtx.atmosphere.numos.weather.gameWeather 中游戏天气相匹配的预设。关闭时仅使用 rtx.atmosphere.numos.weather.preset。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.numos.weather.transitionSeconds
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_numos_weather.h:37
+msgid "The blend time into a new weather, in seconds, when the game does not supply a blend factor. 0 is instant."
+msgstr "游戏未提供混合系数时，过渡到新天气所需的秒数。0 表示立即切换。"
+
